  "BK_9050_0050_SIN": "「ジャンヌ、[RUBY:BASE ]君[RUBY:BEGIN ]きみ[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]少[RUBY:BEGIN ]すこ[RUBY:END ]しだけ[RUBY:BASE ]見[RUBY:BEGIN ]み[RUBY:END ]せてあげよう。\r\nその[RUBY:BASE ]道[RUBY:BEGIN ]みち[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]歩[RUBY:BEGIN ]あゆ[RUBY:END ]み[RUBY:BASE ]続[RUBY:BEGIN ]つづ[RUBY:END ]ければ、\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]君[RUBY:BEGIN ]きみ[RUBY:END ]がどうなるかを！」",
  "BK_9070_0090_JEA": "セレッサは！？」",
  "SM_009010_0150_JEA": "「おい[RUBY:BASE ]悪魔[RUBY:BEGIN ]あくま[RUBY:END ]。\r\nお[RUBY:BASE ]前[RUBY:BEGIN ]まえ[RUBY:END ]をそこから[RUBY:BASE ]出[RUBY:BEGIN ]だ[RUBY:END ]してやろう。ただし――\r\nセレッサを[RUBY:BASE ]探[RUBY:BEGIN ]さが[RUBY:END ]すのを[RUBY:BASE ]手伝[RUBY:BEGIN ]てつだ[RUBY:END ]うのならな」",
