  "LV_009015_0000_NAR": "『オマエは、あの[RUBY:BASE ]弱虫[RUBY:BEGIN ]よわむし[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]仲間[RUBY:BEGIN ]なかま[RUBY:END ]なのか？』",
