  "LV_009055_0000_SIN": "[RUBY:BASE ]君[RUBY:BEGIN ]きみ[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]残酷[RUBY:BEGIN ]ざんこく[RUBY:END ]な[RUBY:BASE ]最期[RUBY:BEGIN ]さいご[RUBY:END ]を、[RUBY:BASE ]何度[RUBY:BEGIN ]なんど[RUBY:END ]も[RUBY:BASE ]見[RUBY:BEGIN ]み[RUBY:END ]たくない……",
