  "CE_009815_0000_SIN": "[RUBY:BASE ]今度[RUBY:BEGIN ]こんど[RUBY:END ]はどんなものが[RUBY:BASE ]飛[RUBY:BEGIN ]と[RUBY:END ]び[RUBY:BASE ]出[RUBY:BEGIN ]だ[RUBY:END ]すかな？",
  "SM_009020_0150_NAR": "『どうする、とは？』\r\nチャールズはぶっきらぼうに[RUBY:BASE ]答[RUBY:BEGIN ]こた[RUBY:END ]えます。",
  "SM_009010_0270_JEA": "「こんなヤツでも、[RUBY:BASE ]少[RUBY:BEGIN ]すこ[RUBY:END ]しは[RUBY:BASE ]役[RUBY:BEGIN ]やく[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]立[RUBY:BEGIN ]た[RUBY:END ]つだろう。\r\n……[RUBY:BASE ]悪魔[RUBY:BEGIN ]あくま[RUBY:END ]よ。\r\nお[RUBY:BASE ]前[RUBY:BEGIN ]まえ[RUBY:END ]、[RUBY:BASE ]名[RUBY:BEGIN ]な[RUBY:END ]は[RUBY:BASE ]何[RUBY:BEGIN ]なん[RUBY:END ]という？」",
  "SM_009010_0110_NAR": "『……フン。あいつがどこに[RUBY:BASE ]行[RUBY:BEGIN ]い[RUBY:END ]ったのかは、\r\nオレも[RUBY:BASE ]知[RUBY:BEGIN ]し[RUBY:END ]らない』\r\nチェシャは[RUBY:BASE ]苦[RUBY:BEGIN ]くる[RUBY:END ]しそうに、なんとか[RUBY:BASE ]声[RUBY:BEGIN ]こえ[RUBY:END ]を\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]絞[RUBY:BEGIN ]しぼ[RUBY:END ]り[RUBY:BASE ]出[RUBY:BEGIN ]だ[RUBY:END ]します。",
  "BK_9040_0090_NAR": "[RUBY:BASE ]二人[RUBY:BEGIN ]ふたり[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]前[RUBY:BEGIN ]まえ[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]現[RUBY:BEGIN ]あらわ[RUBY:END ]れた、\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]不気味[RUBY:BEGIN ]ぶきみ[RUBY:END ]な[RUBY:BASE ]気配[RUBY:BEGIN ]けはい[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]主[RUBY:BEGIN ]ぬし[RUBY:END ]。\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]宙[RUBY:BEGIN ]ちゅう[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]漂[RUBY:BEGIN ]ただよ[RUBY:END ]う[RUBY:BASE ]姿[RUBY:BEGIN ]すがた[RUBY:END ]は、\r\nまるで[RUBY:BASE ]亡霊[RUBY:BEGIN ]ぼうれい[RUBY:END ]のようです。",
  "CE_009805_1000_SIN": "[RUBY:BASE ]残酷[RUBY:BEGIN ]ざんこく[RUBY:END ]な[RUBY:BASE ]結末[RUBY:BEGIN ]けつまつ[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]受[RUBY:BEGIN ]う[RUBY:END ]け[RUBY:BASE ]入[RUBY:BEGIN ]い[RUBY:END ]れるのか、ジャンヌよ？",
