  "BK_9040_0160_SIN": "あの[RUBY:BASE ]者[RUBY:BEGIN ]もの[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]思[RUBY:BEGIN ]おも[RUBY:END ]わぬ[RUBY:BASE ]抵抗[RUBY:BEGIN ]ていこう[RUBY:END ]で、\r\nこんなところに[RUBY:BASE ]来[RUBY:BEGIN ]く[RUBY:END ]る[RUBY:BASE ]羽目[RUBY:BEGIN ]はめ[RUBY:END ]になってしまった」",
  "SM_009020_0240_JEA": "「フッ……そうか」",
  "BK_9040_0210_JEA": "「[RUBY:BASE ]引[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひ[RUBY:END ]かぬのなら、[RUBY:BASE ]私[RUBY:BEGIN ]わたし[RUBY:END ]がアンブラの[RUBY:BASE ]裁[RUBY:BEGIN ]さば[RUBY:END ]きを[RUBY:BASE ]下[RUBY:BEGIN ]くだ[RUBY:END ]す！」",
  "CE_009830_0000_JEA": "セレッサのトラウマなどと、ふざけた[RUBY:BASE ]真似[RUBY:BEGIN ]まね[RUBY:END ]を！",
