  "LV_009015_0030_JEA": "……あいつは[RUBY:BASE ]弱虫[RUBY:BEGIN ]よわむし[RUBY:END ]だが、その[RUBY:BASE ]目[RUBY:BEGIN ]め[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]奥[RUBY:BEGIN ]おく[RUBY:END ]には\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]計[RUBY:BEGIN ]はか[RUBY:END ]り[RUBY:BASE ]知[RUBY:BEGIN ]し[RUBY:END ]れない[RUBY:BASE ]強[RUBY:BEGIN ]つよ[RUBY:END ]さを[RUBY:BASE ]秘[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひ[RUBY:END ]めている",
  "CE_009825_4000_SIN": "こいつ……[RUBY:BASE ]私[RUBY:BEGIN ]わたし[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]触[RUBY:BEGIN ]ふ[RUBY:END ]れるな！",
  "SM_009010_0040_JEA": "「！？\r\nお[RUBY:BASE ]前[RUBY:BEGIN ]まえ[RUBY:END ]、[RUBY:BASE ]何者[RUBY:BEGIN ]なにもの[RUBY:END ]だ！？」",
  "SM_009010_0280_NAR": "『[RUBY:BASE ]名前[RUBY:BEGIN ]なまえ[RUBY:END ]などない！』\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]穴[RUBY:BEGIN ]あな[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]中[RUBY:BEGIN ]なか[RUBY:END ]から[RUBY:BASE ]助[RUBY:BEGIN ]たす[RUBY:END ]けてもらったチェシャですが、\r\nジャンヌの[RUBY:BASE ]態度[RUBY:BEGIN ]たいど[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]不満[RUBY:BEGIN ]ふまん[RUBY:END ]そうです。",
  "BK_9040_0060_JEA": "「セレッサ！！」",
  "SM_009010_0070_JEA": "「お[RUBY:BASE ]前[RUBY:BEGIN ]まえ[RUBY:END ]、[RUBY:BASE ]悪魔[RUBY:BEGIN ]あくま[RUBY:END ]か……？\r\nそんなところで[RUBY:BASE ]何[RUBY:BEGIN ]なに[RUBY:END ]をやっている？\r\nセレッサはどこだ！」",
