  "CE_009800_0000_SIN": "[RUBY:BASE ]抗[RUBY:BEGIN ]あらが[RUBY:END ]うのは[RUBY:BASE ]無意味[RUBY:BEGIN ]むいみ[RUBY:END ]だ！",
