  "LV_009040_0020_NAR": "[RUBY:BASE ]二人[RUBY:BEGIN ]ふたり[RUBY:END ]は、ようやくセレッサの[RUBY:BASE ]居場所[RUBY:BEGIN ]いばしょ[RUBY:END ]を\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]突[RUBY:BEGIN ]つ[RUBY:END ]き[RUBY:BASE ]止[RUBY:BEGIN ]と[RUBY:END ]めたのでしょうか……？",
  "BK_9020_0000_JEA": "「セレッサ……！」",
