  "LV_009030_0000_JEA": "あれは……ヒビ[RUBY:BASE ]割[RUBY:BEGIN ]わ[RUBY:END ]れ？\r\nフン、[RUBY:BASE ]妖精[RUBY:BEGIN ]ようせい[RUBY:END ]どもの[RUBY:BASE ]悪[RUBY:BEGIN ]わる[RUBY:END ]ふざけか？",
